  input9: {fileID: 166692353}
  input10: {fileID: 1506935601}
  input11: {fileID: 294675654}
  input12: {fileID: 2135726176}
  input13: {fileID: 1704862594}
  input14: {fileID: 678141847}
  input15: {fileID: 1523689274}
  input16: {fileID: 1481858221}
  input17: {fileID: 1999252656}
  input18: {fileID: 672085903}
  input19: {fileID: 2073690873}
  input20: {fileID: 103467305}
  input21: {fileID: 927405184}
  input22: {fileID: 751080662}
  input23: {fileID: 783203271}
  input24: {fileID: 561008761}
  input25: {fileID: 1809501604}
  input26: {fileID: 2110751849}
  input27: {fileID: 122071038}
  input28: {fileID: 383200709}
  input29: {fileID: 134432801}
  input30: {fileID: 0}
  resultadoText: {fileID: 537261597}
  respuestaCorrecta1: He will wipe away every tear from their eyes
  respuestaCorrecta2: and death shall be no more
  respuestaCorrecta3: neither shall there be mourning
  respuestaCorrecta4: nor crying
  respuestaCorrecta5: nor pain anymore
  respuestaCorrecta6: for the former things have passed away
  respuestaCorrecta7: And he who was seated on the throne said
  respuestaCorrecta8: Behold
  respuestaCorrecta9: I am making all things new
  respuestaCorrecta10: Also he said
  respuestaCorrecta11: Write this down
  respuestaCorrecta12: for these words are trustworthy and true
  respuestaCorrecta13: And he said to me
  respuestaCorrecta14: It is done
  respuestaCorrecta15: I am the Alpha and the Omega
  respuestaCorrecta16: the beginning and the end
  respuestaCorrecta17: To the thirsty I will give from the spring of the water of
    life without payment
  respuestaCorrecta18: The one who conquers will have this heritage
  respuestaCorrecta19: and I will be his God and he will be my son
  respuestaCorrecta20: But as for the cowardly
  respuestaCorrecta21: the faithless
  respuestaCorrecta22: the detestable
  respuestaCorrecta23: as for murderers
  respuestaCorrecta24: the sexually immoral
  respuestaCorrecta25: sorcerers
  respuestaCorrecta26: idolaters
  respuestaCorrecta27: and all liars
  respuestaCorrecta28: their portion will be in the lake that burns with fire and
    sulfur
  respuestaCorrecta29: which is the second death
  respuestaCorrecta30: 
